node_modules/

# Bit's local workspace state (scope objects, caches, watcher locks, tokens).
# Regenerated by `bit install` / `bit start`; never useful in VCS.
.bit/

*.log

# NOTE: `dist/` is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# `action.yml` declares `main: dist/index.js`, and GitHub Actions runs a
# JavaScript action's bundle verbatim — there is no install or build step on
# the runner. The bundle therefore MUST be committed for the action to work at
# all. Rebuild it with `npm run bundle` and verify it with
# `npm run verify-bundle` (which fails if the committed bundle is stale).
